        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: NASA\n- Groups: NASA Astronaut Group 15\n- Films: Pretty Woman\n- People: Julia Roberts, Garry Marshall, J. F. Lawton\n- Concepts: The Flying Escargot\n\nFacts:\n- Pretty Woman is a 1990 American romantic comedy film directed by Garry Marshall from a screenplay by J. F. Lawton.\n- Julia Roberts became a Hollywood star after headlining Pretty Woman in 1990, and the film grossed US $464 million worldwide.\n- NASA Astronaut Group 15 adopted “The Flying Escargot” as its moniker, possibly referring to two group members being from France or to the “flying escargot” scene in Pretty Woman.",
